>>What happened? Is a polymorphed nurse not the real thing?
>  I think (and someone will probably verify this from source) that polymorph-
>ing creatures only alters the mode of attack, and probably hit points. I
>once polymorphed a shopkeeper into a xorn; when the xorn killed me, it took my
>possessions! This would indicate that it was still attacking as a shopkeeper?
>Does anyone have similar experiences? What about polymorphing the dog into
>something more useful? Does it still attack as a dog?
